insert into public.replies (id, ticket_id, brand_id, author_id, source, external_id, body, sent_at) values
  ('d0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'b0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004', 'seed', 'voltra-r1', 'Hi Mario,

On a new S2 that''s usually the pads bedding in, and it isn''t dangerous as long as the brake stops you firmly. Two things fix most cases:

1. Ten firm stops from about 15 km/h on a dry road.
2. If it still squeals, the caliper may be slightly off-centre: loosen the two 5 mm bolts, squeeze the lever, and tighten them while holding it. Our 2-minute video: voltra.example/brake-align

If the lever feels soft or it takes longer to stop than it used to, stop riding it and tell me; that''s a different problem and we''ll handle it straight away.

Aisha, Voltra Support', now() - interval '116383 minutes'),
  ('d0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002', 'c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002', 'b0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003', 'seed', 'voltra-r2', 'Hi Paula,

Of course. Order VT-82863 was delivered 11 days ago, so you''re inside our 30-day window, and a sealed box means a full refund.

Your prepaid label is attached. Once the courier scans it, the refund goes back to your card within 5 working days.

Dani, Voltra Support', now() - interval '123746 minutes'),
  ('d0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003', 'c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003', 'b0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004', 'seed', 'voltra-r3', 'Hi Pablo,

