2. If it still squeals, the caliper may be slightly off-centre: loosen the two 5 mm bolts, squeeze the lever, and tighten them while holding it. Our 2-minute video: voltra.example/brake-align

If the lever feels soft or it takes longer to stop than it used to, stop riding it and tell me; that''s a different problem and we''ll handle it straight away.

Aisha, Voltra Support', now() - interval '116649 minutes'),
  ('d0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005', 'c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005', 'b0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004', 'seed', 'voltra-r5', 'Hi Iván,

Fair question. The 40 km figure is measured with a 75 kg rider at 15 km/h on flat ground at 20°C, in Eco mode. Three things usually explain a gap like yours:

- Sport mode uses roughly 35% more battery than Eco.
- Tyres below 50 psi cost a lot of range; they lose pressure over the first weeks.
- Below 10°C, expect 20 to 30% less.

Could you try one full charge in Eco at 50 psi and tell me the distance? If you''re still under 24 km, the app can run a battery health test (Settings > Diagnostics) and we''ll replace the pack under warranty if it flags.

Aisha, Voltra Support', now() - interval '118605 minutes'),
  ('d0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006', 'c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006', 'b0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004', 'seed', 'voltra-r6', 'Hi Diego,

I''ve checked order VT-24943: it left our warehouse yesterday afternoon after a stock delay on the Pro in grey, which I''m sorry nobody told you about. Tracking is SEUR 2873 1190 44, and it''s due with you on Thursday.

If Thursday doesn''t suit, you can change the day from the SEUR link.

Aisha, Voltra Support', now() - interval '123251 minutes'),
