  ('d0000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000001a', 'c0000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000001a', 'b0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004', 'seed', 'voltra-r26', 'Hi Elena,

Sorry, that''s frustrating, especially after a full night on the charger. Before we talk returns, let''s rule out the two things behind most of these:

1. Hold the power button for a full 5 seconds. A short press does nothing on the S2 by design.
2. Look at the charger light while it''s plugged into the scooter. If it stays green, the connector isn''t fully seated: push it in until it clicks and charge again.

I can see order VT-33976 was delivered on the 3rd, so you''re well inside warranty whatever happens. If neither step works, reply with what the display shows (even if it''s blank) and I''ll send a replacement battery or a return label, whichever you prefer.

Aisha, Voltra Support', now() - interval '95329 minutes'),
