For oily skin with breakouts, most people start with two products:

- Clear Glow serum (niacinamide + azelaic acid) in the evening.
- Light Gel moisturiser in the morning; it''s oil-free and won''t feel heavy.

Introduce the serum every other night for the first week, and patch test on your jaw for 24 hours first. If breakouts are painful or persistent, a pharmacist is the right next stop.

Warmly,
